\v 13 A copy¦231421 of¦231421 the¦231422 decree was¦231423 to¦231423 be¦231423 included as law¦231424 in¦231425 every¦231425 province¦231427 and¦231428 to be displayed¦231429 to¦231430 all¦231430 the¦231432 people¦231432 so¦231433 that the Jews could be prepared¦231436 to¦231440 fight back against their¦231441 enemies¦231441 on that day¦231438.
