\p
\v 15 The¦231462 king¦231462 \add gave\add* Mordekai royal¦231464 clothing¦231463 that was blue and¦231466 white¦231466, with a¦231467 large¦231469 gold¦231468 crown¦231467, and¦231470 a¦231470 purple¦231472 robe¦231470 made from fine¦231471 linen¦231471. The¦231473 people of Shushan¦231474 cheered happily when¦231476 Mordekai exited¦231459 \add the palace\add*.
