\v 17 In every¦231485 single province and in every¦231489 single city, wherever¦231494 the¦231495 letter announcing the¦231497 king's¦231497 decree was¦231499 brought, the Jews were very cheerful¦231501 and had big celebrations. Many¦231506 people¦231507 from other groups in the¦231508 empire became¦231509 afraid of¦231513 the¦231515 Jews, so they \add converted to Judaism\add* themselves.
\c 9
