\v 16 The Jews in¦231804 the¦231804 other parts of¦231804 the¦231805 empire, who had gathered¦231806 together to fight for their¦231811 \add #lives¦231811\add* had¦231812 defeated their enemies and¦231814 killed¦231814 75,000 of¦231815 them¦231815. But they \add too\add* did not¦231820 take the things that had belonged to their¦231824 enemies.
