\v 28 \add ≈So\add* that's why every Jewish family in¦232091 every¦232091 generation \add since\add* has celebrated these days as holidays, wherever they¦232105 live. The¦232107 Jewish community and¦232108 its descendants will¦232111 always \add faithfully\add* observe¦232090 this festival of¦232112 ‘Purim¦232102’.
\p
