\v 3 Mordekai¦232228 the¦232229 Jew¦232229 was¦232230 second-in-command to¦232231 the¦232231 king¦232231 Ahasuerus¦232232, and¦232233 a leader among the Jews¦232234. He¦232235 was¦232235 popular¦232235 with most of his¦232237 own people¦232240, seeking¦232238 good¦232239 for¦232240 them and¦232241 teaching all¦232243 his¦232245 \add ≈descendants\add* \add how to live in\add* peace¦232242.
